#====================================================================
# Draft: Conan 2 recipe with patches -- conan create fails with
#        FileNotFoundError for the patch file unless patches/* is listed
#        in exports_sources (patch_file resolves against the
#        export_sources folder, not the source folder)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-VCF-SPLIT-PATCH-EXPORT-SOURCES
trigger_tool:           conan|CI|build
phase:                  source|build|CI
error_signature:        FileNotFoundError: \[Errno 2\] No such file or directory: '.*/s/patches/.*\.patch'|Error in build\(\) method.*apply_conandata_patches|apply_conandata_patches\(self\)|conandata\.yml not defined

severity:               2
category:               conan|build-system|recipe
match_keywords:         apply_conandata_patches, exports_sources, export_sources_folder, patch_file, patches, conandata.yml, conan create, FileNotFoundError, Conan 2, recipe migration

title:                  Conan 2 配方用补丁时必须在 exports_sources 里声明 patches/*：patch_file 是相对 export_sources_folder 解析的，而非 source_folder

root_cause:             Conan 2 的 conan.tools.files.apply_conandata_patches() 对 "patch_file" 条目的解析是
                        patch_file_path = os.path.join(conanfile.export_sources_folder, patch_file)
                        —— 基准目录是 **export_sources_folder**，不是 source_folder。因此仅写
                        exports_sources = "conandata.yml" 的配方即便在 conandata.yml 的 patches 段落里
                        正确声明了 "patches/0001-xxx.patch"，补丁文件也不会被复制进 recipe 的导出目录，
                        conan create 会在 build() 调用 apply_conandata_patches(self) 时抛
                        FileNotFoundError，且报错路径形如 <cache>/p/<pkg>/s/patches/0001-xxx.patch，
                        容易误导为"source_folder 里没这个文件"。对照：Conan 1 时代 exports_sources 与
                        source 的边界不同，从 Conan 1 配方迁移过来时极易踩中。
affected_scope:         所有使用 conandata.yml patches 段 + apply_conandata_patches() 的 Conan 2 配方；
                        尤其是"原本无补丁、后来新增补丁"的配方——首次加补丁时只改了 conandata.yml 与
                        patches/ 目录，忘了同步 exports_sources，本地不跑 conan create 就到不了 CI 才发现。
verification_cmd:       conan create . -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing && \
                        conan cache path <name>/<version>:<pkgid> && ls <cache>/e/../es/patches/
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           declare-patches-in-exports-sources
rec_description:        (1) 只要 conandata.yml 里出现 patches 段，exports_sources 就必须同时覆盖补丁文件，
                        标准写法：exports_sources = "conandata.yml", "patches/*"；
                        (2) 症状识别：build() 里 apply_conandata_patches 抛 FileNotFoundError 且路径含
                        "/s/patches/" 或 "/export_source/" 时，先查 exports_sources 是否声明了 patches/*，
                        不要去 source_folder 找文件、也不要改补丁内容；
                        (3) 排查手段：conan create 的导出日志会打印 "Copied N '.patch' file: xxx.patch"，
                        没有这一行即说明补丁未被导出——比读 build() 报错更快定位；
                        (4) 新增补丁后必须本地重跑一次 conan create（W3），该缺陷在 conan export 阶段
                        静默通过、只在 build() 才爆发。
rec_command:            exports_sources = "conandata.yml", "patches/*"
rec_auto_fix:           false

# ═══ 知识协作 (Authorship & Provenance) ═══
# PR 交付后回填（与仓内绝大多数草稿同阶段做法一致）
source_pr:
source_commit:
